{"seq":1,"slug":"sparse-attention","title":"稀疏注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/sparse-linear/sparse-attention","wordCount":1637,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"稀疏注意力\">稀疏注意力</h1><p>稀疏注意力的赌注只有一句话：一个 token 真正需要看的，从来不是整段历史，而是其中一小撮。语言里的依赖大多是局部的，加上少数几个远处的锚点（标题、指代对象、上一段的结论）。既然稠密注意力矩阵里绝大多数格子的权重本就接近零，那不如从一开始就不去计算它们。本篇是本 hub 里「看谁」这条线的主讲——保留 softmax 的精确语义，只在<strong>该看的位置</strong>上算注意力，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的配对数按结构削减。至于「怎么算」（去 softmax）留给 <a href=\"linear-attention\">线性注意力</a>，「近似到什么程度」留给 <a href=\"low-rank-kernel\">低秩与核方法</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-给注意力矩阵打孔\">核心概念：给注意力矩阵打孔</h2><p>稠密注意力让第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 query 与全部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个 key 配对；稀疏注意力预先定义一个稀疏掩码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，只允许 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 关注一个子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⊆</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{S}_i \\subseteq \\{1,\\dots,N\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.075em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，其余位置直接不算。若每个 token 的可见集合大小固定为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，则总配对数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Nw</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。掩码的形状就是稀疏「模式」，不同模式对应不同的信息流假设。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Dense[&quot;稠密注意力&lt;br/&gt;每 token 看全部 N 个&lt;br/&gt;配对数 N^2&quot;] --&gt; Prune[&quot;按结构剪枝&lt;br/&gt;预定义可见集合 S_i&quot;]&#10;    Prune --&gt; Local[&quot;局部窗口&lt;br/&gt;只看邻近 w 个&quot;]&#10;    Prune --&gt; Strided[&quot;跨步/膨胀&lt;br/&gt;每隔 k 个看一个&quot;]&#10;    Prune --&gt; Global[&quot;全局枢纽&lt;br/&gt;少数 token 人人可见&quot;]&#10;    Local --&gt; Combo[&quot;组合模式&lt;br/&gt;局部+全局 = 线性成本+全局感受野&quot;]&#10;    Strided --&gt; Combo&#10;    Global --&gt; Combo\">flowchart TD\n    Dense[\"稠密注意力&lt;br/&gt;每 token 看全部 N 个&lt;br/&gt;配对数 N^2\"] --&gt; Prune[\"按结构剪枝&lt;br/&gt;预定义可见集合 S_i\"]\n    Prune --&gt; Local[\"局部窗口&lt;br/&gt;只看邻近 w 个\"]\n    Prune --&gt; Strided[\"跨步/膨胀&lt;br/&gt;每隔 k 个看一个\"]\n    Prune --&gt; Global[\"全局枢纽&lt;br/&gt;少数 token 人人可见\"]\n    Local --&gt; Combo[\"组合模式&lt;br/&gt;局部+全局 = 线性成本+全局感受野\"]\n    Strided --&gt; Combo\n    Global --&gt; Combo</pre><p>三种基础模式各补一块短板：<strong>局部窗口</strong>保证近距离细节，但感受野随层数才缓慢扩大；<strong>跨步/膨胀</strong>用稀疏采样迅速拉大感受野，代价是漏掉中间细节；<strong>全局枢纽 token</strong>（如 <code>[CLS]</code>、分隔符）被所有位置关注、也关注所有位置，充当远程信息的中转站。Longformer 与 BigBird 的核心贡献，就是证明「局部窗口 + 少量全局 token + 一点随机连边」的组合能在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 成本下逼近稠密注意力的表达力，且在理论上仍是图灵完备的序列函数逼近器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"静态稀疏模式-longformer-bigbird-的分工\">静态稀疏模式：Longformer、BigBird 的分工</h2><p>早期稀疏注意力用<strong>固定不变</strong>的掩码，好处是掩码与输入无关、可提前编译成高效 kernel。下表把几种代表模式的结构说清：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>稀疏模式</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>全局信息如何流动</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>局部窗口（Sliding Window）</td>\n<td>每 token 看两侧各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(Nw)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>靠层数堆叠扩感受野</td>\n<td>短程依赖为主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Longformer</td>\n<td>局部窗口 + 任务相关全局 token</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(Nw)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>全局 token 直连所有位置</td>\n<td>文档级 QA/分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BigBird</td>\n<td>局部 + 全局 + 随机边</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(Nw)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>随机边 + 全局枢纽</td>\n<td>长文档、理论保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨步/膨胀（Dilated）</td>\n<td>每隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个 key 采样</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(Nw)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大步长快速覆盖远程</td>\n<td>需大感受野的层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>静态稀疏的软肋在于「模式是人拍脑袋定的」——它假设重要位置的分布固定，但真实的重要 key 随内容而变。窗口开小了漏信息，开大了又逼近稠密。于是研究重心转向让稀疏模式<strong>跟着内容动</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态与可训练稀疏-2025-的-nsa-与-moba\">动态与可训练稀疏：2025 的 NSA 与 MoBA</h2><p>2025 年稀疏注意力的关键转折，是让稀疏模式<strong>端到端可训练</strong>，而不是推理时才硬套一个固定掩码。这解决了老稀疏方法的顽疾：训练用稠密、推理换稀疏，两者不一致导致质量掉点。DeepSeek 的 <strong>NSA（Native Sparse Attention）</strong> 用一套分层策略——先把 token 压成粗粒度块做全局扫描，再在块内做细粒度选择，最后叠一个局部滑动窗口，三条支路的输出加权融合。它的关键设计是「算术强度平衡」：稀疏选择的粒度对齐 GPU 的访存块，因此在 64K 长度上前向、反向、解码三个阶段都能真实加速，而不只是理论上的 FLOPs 更少（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.11089\">论文 arXiv:2502.11089</a>）。</p>\n<p>Kimi 的 <strong>MoBA（Mixture of Block Attention）</strong> 走另一条路：把上下文切成块，用一个类 MoE 的路由器为每个 query 选出 top-k 个相关块只在其上做注意力。MoBA 的稀疏在短到长适配阶段训练路由器，工程上能与稠密注意力无缝切换，但它主要加速 prefill；NSA 的 token 级三支路设计则同时覆盖 prefill 与 decode——这个「能不能救 decode」的差别，正是 <a href=\"../foundations/why-attention-expensive\">为何注意力昂贵</a> 里 prefill/decode 两张成本画像的直接落点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[&quot;当前 query&quot;] --&gt; Route[&quot;按内容选可见块&quot;]&#10;    Route --&gt; Cmp[&quot;压缩支路&lt;br/&gt;粗粒度块全局扫描&quot;]&#10;    Route --&gt; Sel[&quot;选择支路&lt;br/&gt;细粒度 top-k 块&quot;]&#10;    Route --&gt; Win[&quot;滑窗支路&lt;br/&gt;局部邻域&quot;]&#10;    Cmp --&gt; Merge[&quot;门控加权融合&lt;br/&gt;三支路输出&quot;]&#10;    Sel --&gt; Merge&#10;    Win --&gt; Merge&#10;    Merge --&gt; Out[&quot;注意力输出&lt;br/&gt;O(N) 成本&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Q[\"当前 query\"] --&gt; Route[\"按内容选可见块\"]\n    Route --&gt; Cmp[\"压缩支路&lt;br/&gt;粗粒度块全局扫描\"]\n    Route --&gt; Sel[\"选择支路&lt;br/&gt;细粒度 top-k 块\"]\n    Route --&gt; Win[\"滑窗支路&lt;br/&gt;局部邻域\"]\n    Cmp --&gt; Merge[\"门控加权融合&lt;br/&gt;三支路输出\"]\n    Sel --&gt; Merge\n    Win --&gt; Merge\n    Merge --&gt; Out[\"注意力输出&lt;br/&gt;O(N) 成本\"]</pre><p>微软的 SeerAttention、InfLLM-V2 等进一步把「稠密与稀疏可切换」做进同一套权重：短序列走稠密保精度，长序列自动切稀疏省成本。这类可学习稀疏是 2026 年长上下文模型的主流选择之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬件友好性-稀疏的隐藏成本\">硬件友好性：稀疏的隐藏成本</h2><p>稀疏在纸面上把 FLOPs 降了一个量级，但落到 GPU 上未必等比例加速——这是稀疏注意力最容易被忽视的陷阱。原因是 GPU 擅长规则的稠密矩阵乘（Tensor Core 吃满连续块），而不规则的稀疏访存会造成 warp 分化、访存不连续、Tensor Core 利用率骤降。一个「FLOPs 少 90%」的稀疏 kernel 实测可能只快 2 倍，因为省下的乘法换成了昂贵的 gather/scatter。</p>\n<p>因此现代稀疏方法几乎都采用**块稀疏（block-sparse）**而非元素级稀疏：以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64\\times64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>128</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>128</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">128\\times128</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span></span></span></span></span> 的块为最小单位决定「算或不算」，块内仍是稠密矩阵乘，从而复用 Tensor Core 与 <a href=\"../io-aware/flash-attention\">FlashAttention</a> 的分块 kernel。换句话说，稀疏（改算法）与 IO 感知（改实现）在这里天然叠加：块稀疏掩码直接嵌进 FlashAttention 的分块循环，跳过整块的读取与计算，收益相乘。这正印证了 <a href=\"../foundations/efficient-attention-taxonomy\">高效注意力谱系</a> 里「两条正交线可组合」的判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>稀疏注意力保留 softmax 的精确语义，只在预定义或学习出的可见子集上计算，把配对数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 削到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(Nw)=O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>三种基础模式（局部窗口、跨步/膨胀、全局枢纽）互补，Longformer/BigBird 用「局部+全局+随机」组合在线性成本下逼近稠密表达力。</li>\n<li>2025 的 NSA/MoBA 让稀疏模式端到端可训练，消除训练稠密-推理稀疏的不一致；NSA 三支路同时加速 prefill 与 decode，MoBA 主要加速 prefill。</li>\n<li>稀疏的真实加速受硬件友好性制约：元素级稀疏对 GPU 不友好，块稀疏才能复用 Tensor Core，并可直接叠进 FlashAttention kernel。</li>\n<li>本篇管「看谁」；「怎么算」见 <a href=\"linear-attention\">线性注意力</a>，「近似到什么程度」见 <a href=\"low-rank-kernel\">低秩与核方法</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h3><ul>\n<li>同章并列：<a href=\"linear-attention\">线性注意力</a>、<a href=\"low-rank-kernel\">低秩与核方法</a></li>\n<li>定位与前置：<a href=\"../foundations/efficient-attention-taxonomy\">高效注意力谱系</a>、<a href=\"../foundations/why-attention-expensive\">为何注意力昂贵</a></li>\n<li>硬件叠加：<a href=\"../io-aware/flash-attention\">FlashAttention IO 感知</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：稀疏局部注意力的长上下文工程视角见 <a href=\"../../long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods/sparse-local-attention\">62_long-context-llm-techniques / 稀疏与局部注意力</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"稀疏注意力","id":"稀疏注意力"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：给注意力矩阵打孔","id":"核心概念-给注意力矩阵打孔"},{"level":2,"text":"静态稀疏模式：Longformer、BigBird 的分工","id":"静态稀疏模式-longformer-bigbird-的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"动态与可训练稀疏：2025 的 NSA 与 MoBA","id":"动态与可训练稀疏-2025-的-nsa-与-moba"},{"level":2,"text":"硬件友好性：稀疏的隐藏成本","id":"硬件友好性-稀疏的隐藏成本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"高效注意力谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations/efficient-attention-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"线性注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/sparse-linear/linear-attention"}}